 the harder, demanding, and troublesome it gets!\n\nMULTIPLAYER & ONLINE RANKINGS :\nWe are still working to perfect our multiplayer mode and it will be available soon! You will know when it's available, keep checking for updates.\n\nPHYSICS:\nWe have been obsessed with creating the most realistic and futuristic Badminton the world has ever seen. We spent countless hours coding to make sure that you get a good experience, and we believe that we have accomplished that goal.\n\nWe hope that you enjoy playing Badminton, also awesome updates coming soon!", "short_description": "The best VR badminton game ever! Now grab your racket to smash, hit the shuttlecock, do a crazy smash to your opponent like a badminton star!\n\nAwesome updates coming soon!\n\nJoin Our Discord: https://discord.gg/x3pKCaEX3u"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ironstonegames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.ironstonegames.com/user-agreement/", "publisher_name": "Ironstone Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ironstonegames.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SIMULATION", "SPORTS", "ARCADE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "es", "pt", "ru", "zh_CN", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "360628155903440"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer":